<title>USA: Dow industrials higher at start of trade.</title>
<headline>Dow industrials higher at start of trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials followed through on yesterday's rally to open higher on Friday. Comments by Fed chairma Greenspan buoyed bonds which in turn sent stocks up.</p>
<p>Dow Industrials were up 30 at 7167. The 30-year long bond up 16/32 to yield 6.89 percent.</p>
</text>
